{"id":"misterio","lemma":"misterio","pos":"noun","rank":1728,"glosses":["mystery, mysteriousness","crib, nativity scene","mystery, event in Jesus' life"],"ipa":"/misˈteɾjo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"misterios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-misterio.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eso sigue siendo un misterio.","en":"That remains a mystery.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461267","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"to follow","l":"seguir"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"La vida es un gran misterio.","en":"Life is a great mystery.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639221","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,null],"phrases":[[0,2,"the game"]]},{"text":"La vida está llena de misterios.","en":"Life is full of mysteries.","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"full","l":"lleno"},{"g":"of / from"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"the game"]]},{"text":"¿Puedes resolver el misterio?","en":"Can you solve the puzzle?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804238","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to resolve"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Veamos si podemos resolver ese misterio.","en":"Let's see if we can solve that mystery.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594421","words":[{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"to prune","l":"podar"},{"g":"to resolve"},{"g":"that"},null]}]}